WEBVTT

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:30.269
which we look to
as the birthplace of democracy,

00:11:30.269 --> 00:11:36.900
was also a militaristic society
founded on chattel slavery,

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:41.029
where women were completely
excluded from politics.

00:11:41.864 --> 00:11:43.157
So maybe by comparison,

00:11:43.198 --> 00:11:46.368
somewhere like Teotihuacan
was not doing so badly

00:11:46.368 --> 00:11:50.372
at keeping the genie
of inequality in its bottle.

00:11:50.414 --> 00:11:53.375
But maybe we can just forget
about all that, we can look away.

00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:58.130
Perhaps all of these things
I'm talking about are basically outliers.

00:11:59.548 --> 00:12:04.011
Maybe we can still keep
our familiar story of civilization intact.